Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.41,0:00:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.93,0:00:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.55,0:00:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.91,0:00:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.51,0:01:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We showed that Merrick creep, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.11,0:01:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we can focus on\Nthe Battle City Finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.81,0:01:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We may have beaten Merrick this\Ntime, but he'll definitely be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.49,0:01:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe next time he'll\Nactually show his face,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.83,0:01:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,now that he knows my\Nfriends can't be controlled.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.03,0:01:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, I won't forget how\Nyou saved my life back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.45,0:01:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that you can see again,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.09,0:01:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be able to watch\Nme duel all the way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.07,0:01:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,to the top and win the Battle City Finals,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.45,0:01:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.91,0:01:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Serenity,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.91,0:01:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're really\Nexcited to see your big
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.99,0:01:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,brother duel in the\Nfinals But I'll tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.49,0:01:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,between us,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.40,0:01:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,girlfriend Joey's not gonna last\Ntoo much longer in the Battle
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.09,0:01:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,City Tournament Especially once\Nhe has to face me in a duel
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.53,0:01:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.47,0:01:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Who beat who last time?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.81,0:01:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Pure luck Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.23,0:01:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,duel is Kingdom's ancient history And this\Ntime I plan to wipe out both of you boys
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.17,0:01:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll be tough to\Nbeat, Mai Forget about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.15,0:01:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi After what you and\NI have been through the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.33,0:02:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,rest of this tournament's\Ngoing to be a breeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.55,0:02:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.77,0:02:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,it's time to use our locator cards and\Nfind out where the finals are being held.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.29,0:02:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.63,0:02:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, here we come,\NBattle City Finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.51,0:02:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Word on the street is we put them on our\Ndual discs and the secret site is revealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.85,0:02:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes sense to me. Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.07,0:02:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's projecting something. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.03,0:02:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.39,0:02:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It kind of looks like a stadium.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.51,0:02:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But how do we get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.59,0:02:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.53,0:02:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Our satellite network has confirmed\Nthat you are a Battle City finalist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.59,0:02:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand by for directions\Nto Kyber Corp Stadium.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.37,0:02:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems everything's\Ngoing according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.33,0:02:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and I've already done\Nmore than I agreed to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.45,0:02:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I took care of Bacora like you\Nasked, so you could rescue him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.61,0:03:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick And gain the trust of those fools
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.73,0:03:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your turn. You'll get my\NMillennium Rod and the other
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.65,0:03:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,items When you complete your\Nend of the bargain Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.93,0:03:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,My patience is growing thin, Merrick.\NWhat's the next part of the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.59,0:03:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll obtain a dual disc and enter\Nthe Battle City Tournament Finals. I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.65,0:03:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,hand over the objects you seek If you\Ncan win me the cards that I desire
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.07,0:03:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you're not do-list\Nenough to win them yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.47,0:03:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is there something else you're not\Ntelling me about this scheme of yours, Maric?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want the Millennium\NItems or don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.13,0:03:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, I suggest you do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.73,0:03:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to enter the finals is running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.19,0:03:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll need to obtain six Locator\Ncards in order to qualify.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.85,0:03:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, Maric.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.05,0:03:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura, wake up! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.35,0:03:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.37,0:04:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Foolish old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.07,0:04:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.99,0:04:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.25,0:04:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You were shouting and tossing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.65,0:04:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.77,0:04:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It was only a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.25,0:04:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you've been through a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.81,0:04:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This will cheer you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.47,0:04:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi and Joey called\Nwhile you were asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.45,0:04:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and they've both qualified for\Nthe Battle City Tournament Finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.53,0:04:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.44,0:04:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That is excellent news,\Nbut I'm not surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.81,0:04:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they happen to mention\Nwhere the finals are being held?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.71,0:04:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.62,0:04:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so excited by the news,\NI forgot to ask about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.25,0:04:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.19,0:04:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really proud of those boys,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.91,0:04:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,especially since only eight\Nduelists can make it to the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.01,0:04:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And to think I've trained\Ntwo of them myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.45,0:04:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you must lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.21,0:04:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.73,0:04:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You need rest, and we haven't\Ngotten your test results yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.01,0:04:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.03,0:04:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this\Nfoolishness, for my destiny awaits.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.49,0:05:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.63,0:05:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.43,0:05:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That ought to hold him for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.71,0:05:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I must obtain six locator cards\Nto qualify for the battle city finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.15,0:05:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll deliver my winnings to Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.65,0:05:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and the greatest power in\Nthe world will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.43,0:05:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.51,0:05:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Please give me back my stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.43,0:05:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid they belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.73,0:05:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Your duel disk and your locator card\Nare exactly what I am looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.99,0:05:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.19,0:05:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I need those so I can keep dueling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.77,0:05:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop groveling. It's pitiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.83,0:05:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Battle City days are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.73,0:05:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, now then, let's see\Nwhat kind of deck you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.51,0:05:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.42,0:05:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And you call yourself a duelist?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.69,0:05:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.43,0:05:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.07,0:05:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never get to the finals now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.11,0:06:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys hear the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.71,0:06:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Six duelists have already\Nqualified for the final.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.25,0:06:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, I heard it was only four.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.13,0:06:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is running out, and a\Npractice duel would be wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.99,0:06:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.21,0:06:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,These finals are gonna rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.61,0:06:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.89,0:06:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to know where I can find a\NBattle City Duelist immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.45,0:06:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.79,0:06:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't do that again\Nif I were you. Hey, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.93,0:06:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.77,0:06:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.71,0:06:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I must duel now. Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.45,0:06:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a rumor that some duels are\Ngoing on in the cemetery tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.11,0:06:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.53,0:06:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.37,0:06:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no duelist here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.97,0:06:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have been some kind of trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.87,0:06:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you look at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.31,0:06:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared of a crow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.65,0:06:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, dumb bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.65,0:06:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.01,0:07:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ay, smashing night, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.61,0:07:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You have entered the\Nlair of the living dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.91,0:07:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a very nice place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.49,0:07:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, it's a blooming nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.53,0:07:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.55,0:07:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop your dual disc or perish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.67,0:07:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is haunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.61,0:07:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This gets more fun every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.63,0:07:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He was wimpier than the last guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.71,0:07:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we got our fifth locator card.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.51,0:07:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Brilliant, mates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.55,0:07:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,One more card and we've spooked\Nour way right into the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.49,0:07:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.40,0:07:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And we deserve it, especially after\Nwhat happened to us last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.35,0:07:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If that creep bandit Keith\Ndidn't take all our starships,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.57,0:07:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,we would have made it to\Nthe Duelist Kingdom finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.07,0:07:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.98,0:07:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Bones, another bloke is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.83,0:08:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope they gotta locate a card, because\Nif they don't, things are gonna get ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.01,0:08:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Things will also get ugly if they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.29,0:08:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a Duelist in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.97,0:08:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Those fools deceived me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.81,0:08:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The end is near.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.73,0:08:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our turf.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.87,0:08:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.53,0:08:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.83,0:08:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So you are duelists.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.43,0:08:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is how you\Nintimidate the competition,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.87,0:08:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,you're even more hopeless than you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.57,0:08:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no match for my strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.41,0:08:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll do things my way.\NI possess one locator card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.31,0:08:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and if you'd like to have it,\Nyou'll have to duel me for it Fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.41,0:08:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,we have five locator cards,\Nso once we win yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.87,0:08:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll go straight to the Battle\NCity Finals What do you say, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.23,0:08:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen them before,\Nbut who knows where.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.57,0:09:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even remember what I had\Nfor breakfast today Just duel them,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.43,0:09:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,and win that card, Bones I\Ncan duel fair and square,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.93,0:09:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,especially if it means\Na trip to the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.31,0:09:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're going to duel, then take\Noff your mask and show me your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.65,0:09:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you don't stand a ghost\Nof a chance in a duel against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.89,0:09:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So put up your locator\Ncard and let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.91,0:09:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're so confident,\Nwhy not raise the stakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.17,0:09:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner takes all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.87,0:09:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Not likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.19,0:09:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You think we're dumb enough\Nto risk all five cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.23,0:09:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your cowardice comes as no surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.05,0:09:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But let me remind you the finals begin\Nsoon and you're running out of time
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.01,0:09:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.19,0:09:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I have stated my case clearly and\Nif you are wise you will duel me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.41,0:09:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner will go to\Nthe battle city finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.43,0:09:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I accept your challenge. Besides,\Nwith only one locator card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.35,0:09:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be much of a duelist anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.99,0:09:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Accepting my challenge\Nwas your first mistake
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.49,0:09:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I'm through with\Nyou it will be your last
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.21,0:09:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,if you want my locator\Ncard you'll have to be
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.81,0:10:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,prepared for anything\Nhey this fogza stick is a
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.57,0:10:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,really dick soup time\Nto begin our duel so get
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.35,0:10:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,ready are you aware of the\Nlegend of this cemetery
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.01,0:10:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,what legend listen this\Nvery cemetery is haunted
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.31,0:10:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,by the ghost of a knight\Nwho lost his head in
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.85,0:10:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,battle what when the clock\Nstrikes midnight he rises
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.23,0:10:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,up from his grave in\Nsearch of his missing head.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.89,0:10:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.21,0:10:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet Headless Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.43,0:10:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your face is scarier than that\NDuel Monsters card, Bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.17,0:10:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I didn't see it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.83,0:10:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.03,0:10:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid the worst is yet to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.41,0:10:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's creeping me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.49,0:10:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.47,0:10:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll dig up Snake Hair, the Sorceress!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.67,0:11:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll bury your knight in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.65,0:11:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Snakehair, destroy his headless knight\Nwith your stone blizzard attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.31,0:11:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So, it looks like your knight just\Nlost a lot more than his head. Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.09,0:11:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure you, you haven't seen\Nthe last of my headless knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.47,0:11:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So observe and learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.27,0:11:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I reveal my face-down card\Nand its shallow grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.85,0:11:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This magic card allows me to\Nrevive one monster from my
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.43,0:11:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,graveyard and place it back\Non the field in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.61,0:11:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So welcome back, my headless knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.55,0:11:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out, Bonesy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.99,0:11:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The headless guy came back from the grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.33,0:11:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Zygore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.65,0:12:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Snake hair's still got more attack\Npoints than that frimsy knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.85,0:12:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.76,0:12:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a point there, Sid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.33,0:12:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This monster may be too weak,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.33,0:12:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but watch as I sacrifice\Nmy headless knight in order
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.37,0:12:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,to summon a creature stronger\Nthan your snake hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.01,0:12:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise up, Earl of Demise!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.29,0:12:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.47,0:12:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My monster's a goner!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.51,0:12:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, Earl of Demise, attack\Nwith your sword of peril!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.91,0:12:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Snake hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you amateurs had\Nenough punishment yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.39,0:12:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see which one of us is\Nan amateur when I do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.19,0:12:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Dragon Zombie!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.27,0:12:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll unearth my magic burial card!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.01,0:12:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Look familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.73,0:12:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This magic card costs me 800 life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.73,0:13:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,but since it brings snake hair back from\Nthe grave, it's a price I'm willing to pay,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.79,0:13:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,especially once I activate\Nmy polymerization card!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It fuses my two monsters together,\NCreating a creature so terrifying,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.87,0:13:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,it will send shivers down your spine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.41,0:13:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, the great Knight of Burial.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.37,0:13:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You are finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.17,0:13:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Since fusion monsters have to\Nwait one turn before attacking,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.75,0:13:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll lay one card face down, and then\NI'll wait for you to make your next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.79,0:13:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only will my mammoth trample\Nhis monster in my next turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.31,0:13:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but when I spring my trap card on him,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.05,0:13:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,it won't be long before\Nhis locator card is
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.25,0:13:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine. Hey, are you gonna\Ndraw or what? With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.31,0:13:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm playing a trap card\Nskull invitation now
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.79,0:13:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,every time a card is sent\Nto the card graveyard
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.09,0:13:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,my skull invitation card\Nwill severely damage
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.77,0:14:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,your life points so when\Nmy great mammoth of gold
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.99,0:14:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,find destroys your earl\Nof demise in my next turn
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.05,0:14:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,you will lose 300 extra life\Npoints automatically. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.79,0:14:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about having one foot in the grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.07,0:14:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You are finished, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.07,0:14:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your trap card is meaningless to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.59,0:14:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,To prove it, I'll send every card\Nin my hand to the card graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.09,0:14:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be mad as a\Nhatter to make that move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.93,0:14:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't lose, Bonesy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.61,0:14:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.52,0:14:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Skull invitation, do your dirty work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.63,0:14:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, squeeze the\Nlife points right out of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.65,0:14:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.29,0:14:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll soon find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.17,0:14:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only are you about to lose this\Nduel, but when I'm done with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.99,0:14:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll lose so much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.21,0:15:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You were so distracted by\Nthe hopeless thought of
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.99,0:15:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,winning my locator card and\Nadvancing to the finals,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.77,0:15:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,you failed to notice\NI've played a magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.63,0:15:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.15,0:15:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called Spiritualistic Medium,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.13,0:15:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and it provides my Earl of\NDemise with an additional 500
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.67,0:15:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,attack points for every card\Ndestroyed during my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.37,0:15:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.61,0:15:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it can, and if you remember correctly,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.59,0:15:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I destroyed four of my own cards, giving\Nmy monster 2,000 more attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.21,0:15:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, my spirits, and add your\Npower to the Earl of Demise!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.01,0:15:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's grown too powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.41,0:15:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.79,0:15:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Earl of Demise, destroy his mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.53,0:15:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I lose 1,800 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.27,0:15:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And because of your own trap card,\Nyou lose 300 additional life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.31,0:16:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The end is near, And when I win, you\Nand your friends will be trapped here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.83,0:16:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.73,0:16:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.64,0:16:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look around you, you fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.67,0:16:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been dueling in the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.85,0:16:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I transported us here\Nwhen I first arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.05,0:16:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.03,0:16:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What are those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.43,0:16:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are lost souls trapped\Nforever in the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.01,0:16:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And soon you will join them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.41,0:16:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Your soul's doomed to wander in\Nthe darkness of the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.57,0:16:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.55,0:16:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later, lads!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.57,0:16:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Shane, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.07,0:16:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get far.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.77,0:16:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How did I end up back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.23,0:16:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let that be a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.27,0:16:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot run from the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.51,0:16:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Only by defeating me in this duel\Ncan you hope to escape its clutches.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.77,0:17:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Bones, whatever you do,\Ndon't you dare lose this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.79,0:17:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Or we'll end up like these guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.33,0:17:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let me see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.97,0:17:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.49,0:17:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I play the magic card\NNightmare Steel Cage!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.47,0:17:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be trapped in my\Ncage for two whole turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.71,0:17:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,preventing you from\Nattacking till you're free.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.53,0:17:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But just in case, I'll play\Nthis magic card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.31,0:17:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You got him good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.49,0:17:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you have two titans to\Nwipe out his life point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.01,0:17:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.92,0:17:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Think I don't know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.09,0:17:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I draw one card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.05,0:17:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, disappointed because you can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.87,0:17:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,On the contrary, I'm disappointed\Nbecause this duel has to end,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.55,0:17:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and I want it to prolong your misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.51,0:17:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.07,0:17:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you're trapped\Nin my nightmare steel cage,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.85,0:17:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,None of your monsters can carry\Nout an attack for two full turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.67,0:17:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's only partially true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.43,0:18:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There is one card that\Ncan penetrate your cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.71,0:18:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Ectoplasma.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.99,0:18:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ectoplasma extracts the very soul of my\Nmonster and transforms it into an energy
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.49,0:18:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,so powerful it can penetrate your cage\Nand destroy the rest of your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.33,0:18:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.89,0:18:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go, Ectoplasma, and\Nfinish these fools off now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.79,0:18:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.29,0:18:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.89,0:18:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop your whimpering.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.87,0:18:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can save you now. It's over. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.43,0:18:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You dueled me and lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.79,0:18:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And now you must all wander the Shadow\NRealm until I choose to set you free.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.43,0:18:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.77,0:18:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.07,0:18:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh! Oh! Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.01,0:18:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.71,0:18:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's on to the Battle City finals\Nto fulfill my agreement with Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.35,0:19:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And soon, I will obtain\Nthe world's greatest power.
